  "notes": {
    "_leaflet": "PENNY KW 28, Gültig von Mo, 6.7. bis Sa, 11.7. (cover); pages 36/38/40 headed Do, 9.7. \u2013 Sa, 11.7. (copied into c). Pages 27 to 32 (Ab Do, 9.7.) are non-food and were not picked. Big red price = p; small red price under it, labelled \"UVP x.xx\" or unlabelled, = o (taken with the -X% badge). lp = PENNY App price: text \"mit PENNY App x.xx\" or a big price next to \"ohne PENNY App x.xx\" (the ohne-App price is then p); App prices carry footnote 1/2 (registered App users only). Where both App and non-App base prices are printed, bp is the one matching p. Every price was linked to its product by recomputing the printed base price. \"Aktion\" and \"NEU\" badges are not conditions; \"*\" means temporary/not in all stores. Header shows template residue \"Mo, XX.XX. ... Sa, XX.XX.\" on some pages.",
    "10": "FERDI FUCHS: 2.19 Aktion, \"mit PENNY App 1.99\" (1 kg = 7.96). Leberwurst: App 0.99 (-23%, 1 kg = 5.66), ohne App 1.29.",
    "12": "Brand line \"BÄREN-\" / \"MARKE\" split over two lines. MEGGLE: 2.29 (-42%, UVP 3.99, 1 kg = 5.73) and mit PENNY App 1.99 (-50%, 1 kg = 4.98). ROMA: App 0.33 (1 kg = 1.65), ohne App 0.49. DOVGAN: App 2.79 (1 l = 4.23 / 3.88), ohne App 3.99.",
    "14": "Weizenbrötchen arithmetic is inconsistent in print: 6 x 0.19 = 1.14 (o), pay 4 = 0.76 (p, -33%), which is 0.127 per piece, but the badge says ENTSPRICHT 0.14 JE STÜCK; owner should check the image. Laugenbreze 4 x 0.39 = 1.56 (o), 1.00 for 4 (0.25 each). Grillbrot App price 0.88 has its own base price (1 kg = 2.93). The 250 g BÄCKERKRÖNUNG item is Grillies (name on the line under the brand).",
    "16": "ORTO MIO Knoblauch Natur / Toskana Art: App 1.49 (-21%, 1 kg = 12.63 on drained 118 g / 8.05), ohne App 1.89. Artischocken: App 1.49 (-25%), ohne App 1.99.",
    "21": "Coupon \"25% Rabatt auf alle Ferrero-kinder-Artikel\" (App coupon, no price) not listed. CAPRI-SUN: 3.49 (-18%, UVP 4.29) and mit PENNY App 3.29 (-23%, 1 l = 1.65). MERCI: App 2.49 (-28%, 1 kg = 13.46), ohne App 3.49.",
    "23": "LENOR: App 2.19 (-26%, 1 l = 2.74), ohne App 2.99. SOMAT 12.99 has UVP 13.99 but no readable -X% in the text layer. ODOL-MED3 offer also covers DR. BEST Zahnbürsten.",
    "36": "\"Vorteilspack\" label sits near EXQUISA (not used). Lachsseite priced je kg, pack ca. 1.100 g.",
